<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cut Autozone.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cut Autozone.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut its rating on AutoZone Inc to market outperform from recommended list.</p>
<p>-- AutoZone lost 2-1/4 from 21-3/4 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
